    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheddar Beach is an interactive visual novel inspired by old school point-&amp;-click adventure games. In about 45 minutes of gameplay, you\u2019ll meet Hamston &amp; The Homies and traverse the world of Cheddar Beach in search of a crackin\u2019 house party on a Friday night - inspired by Los Angeles in the early 90\u2019s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/a53b18ceb87ddb52632605efbcb00e9b.poster.avif?t=1727429736\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/a53b18ceb87ddb52632605efbcb00e9b.webm?t=1727429736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/a53b18ceb87ddb52632605efbcb00e9b.mp4?t=1727429736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Message From Bryson</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yo, I\u2019ll never forget back in high school when the homie printed out over 100 flyers for a house party that was poppin\u2019 off that weekend. No cell phones. No social media. Hell, no internet. That was a world where you\u2019re NOT making it to that house party on Saturday night unless you have one of those flyers. Or maybe your friend is going, but you don\u2019t have their phone number. How do you unstuck yourself and get to the action?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cheddar Beach you play as Hamston, a young adult hamster. I thought about him as being my \u2018younger self.\u2019 I think back to my college days of trying to adapt to adult life, and the freedoms afforded by it, while also avoiding any adult responsibilities that I could get away with. Actually, wait a minute... I\u2019m STILL Hamston!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, you can be Hamston too! Kinda. Play as Hamston to be the \u2018new guy in town,\u2019 and navigate your way through \u201cThe Chedda.\u201d Fortunately you\u2019ve got your big cousin Gerbert on deck, pushing you forward. Hopefully in the RIGHT direction! Don\u2019t worry though, all you have to do is page the homie Bossa and he\u2019ll swoop in to strongarm you to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/6e67bb748953703579d961fede56cc70.poster.avif?t=1727429736\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/6e67bb748953703579d961fede56cc70.webm?t=1727429736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/6e67bb748953703579d961fede56cc70.mp4?t=1727429736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s get it crackin\u2019! Where\u2019s the party at? Who\u2019s got the 411? Let\u2019s get there, and have a brew. Maybe you\u2019ll meet a nice lady-friend. Who knows what\u2019ll happen tonight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cheddar Beach!</p>",
