Actually, wait a minute... I\u2019m STILL Hamston!!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, you can be Hamston too! Kinda. Play as Hamston to be the \u2018new guy in town,\u2019 and navigate your way through \u201cThe Chedda.\u201d Fortunately you\u2019ve got your big cousin Gerbert on deck, pushing you forward. Hopefully in the RIGHT direction! Don\u2019t worry though, all you have to do is page the homie Bossa and he\u2019ll swoop in to strongarm you to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/6e67bb748953703579d961fede56cc70.poster.avif?t=1727429736\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/6e67bb748953703579d961fede56cc70.webm?t=1727429736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755510/extras/6e67bb748953703579d961fede56cc70.mp4?t=1727429736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s get it crackin\u2019! Where\u2019s the party at? Who\u2019s got the 411? Let\u2019s get there, and have a brew. Maybe you\u2019ll meet a nice lady-friend. Who knows what\u2019ll happen tonight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cheddar Beach!</p>",
